# Allocations that name SCREENCELL without sizing anything from the grid.
# Checked by tests/check-grid-size.sh.
#
#   file|fragment of the statement|reason
#
# A line that matches nothing is stale and fails the check.

we_mouse.c|file = MALLOC(MLEN * sizeof(SCREENCELL))|the cells of one dragged file name, MLEN long
we_mouse.c|bgrd = MALLOC(MLEN * sizeof(SCREENCELL))|the cells behind one dragged file name, MLEN long
